g system tests\n3. Level progression tests\n4. Audio sonification tests\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n| Category | Files | Test Coverage | Status |\n|----------|-------|---------------|--------|\n| **Test Files** | 1 | Basic React tests only | ❌ Insufficient |\n| **Utilities (exist)** | 3 | 0% | ❌ No tests |\n| **Simulation Core** | 0 | 0% | ⚠️ Not implemented |\n| **Game Logic** | 0 | 0% | ⚠️ Not implemented |\n| **UI Components** | 1 | 5% | ❌ Minimal |\n\n**Overall Assessment:** The project is in early development with test framework properly configured, but has virtually no test coverage. Only basic React rendering tests exist. Critical simulation, game logic, and existing utility functions are completely untested. This is a significant gap that should be addressed as features are implemented, especially since the implementation plan explicitly includes testing in Sprint 6.\n</task_result>","title":"Check existing tests","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39e35ad7effeOs5cwFbhEIGwe7","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771167175292,"end":1771167257855}}}}
